                                                "sense_id": "3e7c4cd0-8a3c-34ae-900f-2636e3abd70b",
                                                "text": "In the culinary process, there are none of those peelings and washings as in the case of potatoes and turnips, […] none of those squeezings and mashings and choppings, before the worthless mess can be got upon the table."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
